OL,3,AProsecutors indicate plan to retry
OL,4,ALindsay Clancy for deaths of her three
OL,5,Achildren
OL,6,
OL,7,FLindsay Clancy returned to court for a
OL,8,Fhearing concerning whether she will be
OL,9,Fretried for killing her three young
OL,10,Fchildren in 2023
OL,12,FThe Massachusetts woman's murder trial
OL,13,Ffell apart in September when a jury
OL,14,Fcould not unanimously decide on a
OL,15,Fverdict
OL,17,FProsecutors indicated at the hearing
OL,18,Fthat they plan to retry the case, but
OL,19,Fdon't know "what that looks like"
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
